            "detailed_description": "<h1>Nova atualização</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sundered: Eldritch Edition has been unleashed!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/4a0d7f64933da558030e8cf8242fadbb.poster.avif?t=1752502363\" width=570 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/4a0d7f64933da558030e8cf8242fadbb.webm?t=1752502363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/4a0d7f64933da558030e8cf8242fadbb.mp4?t=1752502363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Hey folks!<br><br>Today, we're unleashing <strong>Sundered: Eldritch Edition</strong>, the definitive edition of of our chaotic metroidvania, containing all previous updates published to the game, along with the brand new <strong>Magnate of the Gong update</strong>! Here’s what’s being added in this latest version:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li><strong>Local co-op:</strong> It’s dangerous to go alone, especially through <i>Sundered’s </i>ever-changing caverns. So we’ve added local co-op multiplayer support for up to 4 players!<br><br>    </li><li><strong>New areas and quest chain:</strong> We’ve added several unique new areas throughout the existing map. Complete a quest chain of special challenges in the new areas to unlock rewards and the path to a brand new boss!</li></ul><br>And that’s just the big stuff! We’ve added a ton of smaller features and improvements under the hood! Check out the full patch notes in the Forums.<br><br>And to be clear, yes, all existing players receive the Eldritch Edition update for <strong>FREE </strong>today!<br><br>Please remember that your feedback is crucial for us, <strong>so please do leave or update your review</strong> on our Store page, and strike up a conversation about this update with us on our Forums! <br><br>Resist or Embrace.<br><br>- Rodrigue and the Thunder Lotus Team</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/fa906893cfaeb3b1e9c28d7fc558887d.poster.avif?t=1752502363\" width=618 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/fa906893cfaeb3b1e9c28d7fc558887d.webm?t=1752502363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/fa906893cfaeb3b1e9c28d7fc558887d.mp4?t=1752502363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resiste ou aceita.</h2><br><i>Sundered </i>é um jogo caótico, desenhado à mão e com inspiração no estilo metroidvania, onde resistes ou aceitas os antigos poderes sobrenaturais. Enfrenta hordas de inimigos terríveis num mundo em constante mutação e inspirado nos trabalhos de H.P. Lovecraft. <i>Sundered </i>é uma abordagem única e desafiante ao género clássico dos criadores de Jotun, agora com modo cooperativo local! <br><br>Assumes o papel de Eshe, um viajante num mundo em ruínas, encurralado em cavernas que mudam constantemente e estão repletas de hordas de inimigos terríveis. Domina o poder de relíquias corrompidas para derrotares bosses gigantes, às custas da tua humanidade. Resiste ou aceita. <br><br><strong>Sundered: Eldritch Edition</strong> inclui a <strong>atualização Magnate of the Gong</strong>, que acrescenta o modo cooperativo local para multijogador - até 4 jogadores - juntamente com novas áreas e uma batalha caótica contra o novo boss Magnate of the Gong!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Caraterísticas:</h2> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Belíssimas animações e gráficos desenhados à mão<br></li><li>Encontros caóticos contra hordas de inimigos<br></li><li>Combates épicos contra bosses<br></li><li>Modo cooperativo local opcional para até 4 jogadores<br></li><li>Centenas de melhorias e múltiplas opções para o personagem<br></li><li>Uma mistura de níveis criados à mão e procedurais<br></li><li>Múltiplos finais e mais de 15 horas de jogo</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/b9c16445caddc2f1a2a6542ceb39657d.poster.avif?t=1752502363\" width=618 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/b9c16445caddc2f1a2a6542ceb39657d.webm?t=1752502363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/b9c16445caddc2f1a2a6542ceb39657d.mp4?t=1752502363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/3c9e0263958b76f2d13e80e6d0e0d506.poster.avif?t=1752502363\" width=618 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/3c9e0263958b76f2d13e80e6d0e0d506.webm?t=1752502363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/3c9e0263958b76f2d13e80e6d0e0d506.mp4?t=1752502363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
