sonagem<br></li><li>Uma mistura de níveis criados à mão e procedurais<br></li><li>Múltiplos finais e mais de 15 horas de jogo</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/b9c16445caddc2f1a2a6542ceb39657d.poster.avif?t=1752502363\" width=618 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/b9c16445caddc2f1a2a6542ceb39657d.webm?t=1752502363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/b9c16445caddc2f1a2a6542ceb39657d.mp4?t=1752502363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/3c9e0263958b76f2d13e80e6d0e0d506.poster.avif?t=1752502363\" width=618 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/3c9e0263958b76f2d13e80e6d0e0d506.webm?t=1752502363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/535480/extras/3c9e0263958b76f2d13e80e6d0e0d506.mp4?t=1752502363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
